  "description": "Drop-in replacement for Avalonia.Skia and Avalonia.Vulkan 12.1.5 that renders Avalonia with Skia Graphite (Vulkan on Windows, Metal on macOS) through SkiaSharp 4.154.0, with optional multi-threaded banded recording, pipelined frames and several dirty rectangles. Opt-in at runtime with AVALONIA_SKIA_GRAPHITE=1; without it the assemblies behave like upstream.",
